        "en": "So the Commander of the Faithful (peace be upon him) said: 'Far be it! O Shurayh, is this how you judge in such a case?' He said: 'O Commander of the Faithful, so how?' He said: 'By Allah, I shall judge regarding them with a judgment that no creature before me has judged with, except the Prophet Dawud (peace be upon him). O Qanbar, call the Thursday police for me!' So he called them, and he assigned a man from the police to each man from them. Then he looked at their faces and said: 'What is it you are saying? Are you saying that I do not know what you did with the father of this youth, that I am ignorant?' Then he said: 'Separate them and cover their heads.'"
      }
